{"conversation":"I think for each token I can count hyphens and punctuation. If hyphen count is more than 1 or punctuation count more than 1, then invalid. Also, if hyphen exist, check if characters around it are letters. For punctuation, check if it's at the end.","python_code":"class Solution:
